---

### **`.gitignore`**

```gitignore
# Node.js
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Environment Variables
# .env
# .env.local
# .env.*.local

# Logs
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Next.js
.next/
out/

# Static Files
.DS_Store

# Testing
coverage/
*.lcov

# Production
build/

# IDE Configs
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sublime-workspace

# MacOS
.DS_Store